             387                     !c!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
             388                     !   convert surface pressure to mb from cb
             389                     !
             390                     !>  - Convert prsl from centibar to millibar, set normalized mass flux to 1, cloud properties to 0, and save model state variables (after advection/turbulence).
                                   <<< Loop-information Start >>>
                                   <<<  [PARALLELIZATION]
